                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2826600,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "But please note, if there are more than nine people on either side of the boat, we'll move some of you over. Otherwise, all 18 of us will end up in the sea. We've recently upgraded all our boats. They used to be jet black, but our new ones now have these comfortable dark red seats and a light green exterior in order to stand out from others and help promote our company. This gives our boats a rather unique appearance, don't you think?",
